### Maurizone API - Favorites & Cart (requires JWT)
### Set BASE and TOKEN after login (e.g. POST /api/auth/login or /api/auth/otp/verify)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ---------- Favorites ----------
### List favorites (paginated)
GET {{base}}/favorites?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List favorite product IDs only
GET {{base}}/favorites/ids
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle favorite (add) - replace :productId with real product id
POST {{base}}/favorites/toggle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle favorite (remove) - 404 if product does not exist
POST {{base}}/favorites/toggle/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Cart ----------
### Get cart (creates if not exists)
GET {{base}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add to cart
POST {{base}}/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Add to cart - invalid productId (404 Product not found)
POST {{base}}/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 99999,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Update cart item quantity
PATCH {{base}}/cart/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 3
}

### Update quantity to 0 (removes item)
PATCH {{base}}/cart/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}

### Invalid quantity (400)
PATCH {{base}}/cart/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 100
}

### Remove item by productId
DELETE {{base}}/cart/remove/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove non-existent item (404 Cart item not found)
DELETE {{base}}/cart/remove/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clear cart
DELETE {{base}}/cart/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Unauthorized (401) - no token ----------
GET {{base}}/favorites
GET {{base}}/cart
